ains an open release blocker.*\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"open the task to build a central audit trail system for track redact activ across the pipelin 2026 07 11 bob loader refactor activ refactor the document loader to prepar for stream input ahead of hash and audit captur 2026 08 05 bob sha 256 hash activ ad sha 256 hash of input stream becaus the audit design requir an input hash alongsid the redact map 2026 08 15 bob audit schema definit activ defin the companion json audit schema hash redact map need befor cli wire 2026 09 10 bob cli integr activ wire audit log generat into the cli path now that the schema wa defin to satisfi the releas gate 2026 09 18 diana audit verifi mismatch activ verif found the cli emit audit record inconsist with the defin schema this mismatch remain an open releas blocker\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e96d1e408a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-26-Audit-Trail-Logging.md\", \"id\": \"a015962ae73f1229\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.28616755282754863, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.07648435403935522, \"vector_similarity\": 0.77542835, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-26-Audit-Trail-Logging.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e96d1e408a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-26-Audit-Trail-Logging.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-26-Audit-Trail-Logging.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 2011, \"chunk_count\": 2, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:02:38\", \"token_count\": 759, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-SLACK-09\\n\\n# Slack Thread: Security Patch - CORS Issue\\n\\n**Channel**: #cipherdoc\\n\\n**Thread opened**: 2026-07-10\\n\\n**Last activity**: 2026-07-15\\n\\n---\\n\\n**[2026-07-10 14:20] Diana**: @Bob, I just ran a security scan on the API. We've got a wide-open CORS policy. `Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *` is a no-go for this project.\\n\\n**[2026-07-10 14:23] Bob**: Oops, that was left over from local testing on the scaffold. I'll tighten it up now.\\n\\n**[2026-07-10 14:43] Bob**: Applying the CORS patch. It now only allows requests from the defined `ALLOWED_ORIGINS` in the environment config.\\n\\n**[2026-07-10 14:50] Diana**: Scan is coming back clean now.\\n\\n**[2026-07-10 14:52] Bob**: Thanks for the catch, Diana. I've added a lint check to prevent `*` from being committed in the future.\\n\\n**[2026-07-10 15:45] Alice**: Good catch. Let's make sure we don't have any other dev-only flags leaking into the main branch.\\n\\n**[2026-07-15 09:54] Diana**: Re-ran the CVE and CORS scans ahead of the release evidence pack — patch is still holding, no regressions since Bob's fix.\\n\\n**[2026-07-15 09:55] Bob**: Good. I'll note that in the security patch record.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src slack 09 slack thread secur patch cor issu channel cipherdoc thread open 2026 07 10 last activ 2026 07 15 2026 07 10 14 20 diana bob i just ran a secur scan on the api we ve got a wide open cor polici access control allow origin is a no go for this project 2026 07 10 14 23 bob oop that wa left over from local test on the scaffold i ll tighten it up now 2026 07 10 14 43 bob appli the cor patch it now onli allow request from the defin allow _ origin in the environ config 2026 07 10 14 50 diana scan is come back clean now 2026 07 10 14 52 bob thank for the catch diana i ve ad a lint check to prevent from be commit in the futur 2026 07 1015 45 alic good catch let s make sure we don t have ani other dev onli flag leak into the main branch 2026 07 15 09 54 diana re ran the cve and cor scan ahead of the releas evid pack patch is still hold no regress sinc bob s fix 2026 07 15 09 55 bob good i ll note that in the secur patch record\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e92a731a8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-07-10-security-patch.md\", \"id\": \"19b85fe455718c06\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.2854167047542262, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.08478587822032312, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7535553, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-07-10-security-patch.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e92a731a8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-07-10-security-patch.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-07-10-security-patch.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1152, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:16\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:03:35\", \"token_count\": 369, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}], \"pagination\": {\"page\": 1, \"page_size\": 10, \"total_chunks\": 70, \"total_pages\": 7}, \"query_info\": {\"question\": \"\\\"security gate\\\" 2026-09-22 next actions critical path hold Docker CVE audit log Windows signing\", \"similarity_threshold\": 0.2, \"vector_weight\": 0.3, \"keyword_search\": false, \"dataset_count\": 1}}"}],"structured_content":null},"error":null,"status":"completed"}}
